The web app's content security policy blocks string evaluation, and the
browser build of emnapi probed `new Function()` when it loaded, so every page
using the regex-set or aho-corasick WASM packages reported a violation. Under
the policy the probe already failed, which selects the fallback that names
functions with `Object.defineProperty`; the bundler entry now selects it
without probing.
Browser regression: apps/web/e2e/specs/content-security-policy-surfaces.spec.ts.

